"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkcasdoor_website=globalThis.webpackChunkcasdoor_website||[]).push([[99],{49645(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","metadata":{"permalink":"/es/blog/casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-22-casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-22-casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape.mdx","title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","description":"On February 22, 2026, Casdoor joined the CNCF Cloud Native Landscape, under the Security & Compliance category in Provisioning. The Landscape brings together widely used cloud-native projects and products; inclusion helps users and enterprises discover and evaluate solutions for building cloud-native systems.","date":"2026-02-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"CNCF","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/cncf"},{"inline":true,"label":"Cloud Native","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/cloud-native"},{"inline":true,"label":"Landscape","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/landscape"},{"inline":true,"label":"IAM","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/iam"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Seguridad","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/seguridad"}],"readingTime":1.94,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Casdoor Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/hsluoyz","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["Casdoor","CNCF","Cloud Native","Landscape","IAM","SSO","Seguridad"],"date":"2026-02-22T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Mejorando la seguridad de la aplicaci\xf3n y la experiencia del usuario con Casdoor Face Authentication SSO","permalink":"/es/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso"}},"content":"On February 22, 2026, **Casdoor** joined the [CNCF Cloud Native Landscape](https://landscape.cncf.io/), under the **Security & Compliance** category in Provisioning. The Landscape brings together widely used cloud-native projects and products; inclusion helps users and enterprises discover and evaluate solutions for building cloud-native systems.\\n\\n[https://landscape.cncf.io/?item=provisioning--security-compliance--casdoor](https://landscape.cncf.io/?item=provisioning--security-compliance--casdoor)\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n<img src=\\"/img/blog/cncf-landscape-casdoor.png\\" alt=\\"Casdoor on CNCF Landscape - Security and Compliance section\\" style={{maxWidth: \'100%\', height: \'auto\', border: \'1px solid #eee\', borderRadius: \'8px\'}} />\\n\\n_Casdoor on the CNCF Cloud Native Landscape (Security & Compliance)_\\n\\n## Sobre Casdoor\\n\\n<div style={{display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'1rem\', flexWrap: \'wrap\', marginBottom: \'1rem\'}}>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/casdoor-logo_1185x256.png\\" alt=\\"Casdoor\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n\\n</div>\\n\\nCasdoor is an open-source, UI-first Identity and Access Management (IAM) / Single Sign-On (SSO) platform with a web UI. It supports OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML, and CAS, as well as many social logins (Google, GitHub, WeChat, etc.), and helps you build user management and SSO in a few steps. Casdoor is developed by [Casbin](https://casbin.org) in Golang and React. It uses a front-end/back-end separation architecture, supports high concurrency, and is actively maintained by the community. The project has received over 13k GitHub stars.\\n\\n## About CNCF and the Cloud Native Landscape\\n\\n<div style={{display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'1.5rem\', flexWrap: \'wrap\', marginBottom: \'1rem\'}}>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https://www.cncf.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/cncf-main-site-logo.svg\\" alt=\\"CNCF - Cloud Native Computing Foundation\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n<img src=\\"https://landscape.cncf.io/images/logo_header.svg\\" alt=\\"CNCF Cloud Native Landscape\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n\\n</div>\\n\\nThe **Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF)** is a Linux Foundation project that promotes cloud-native technologies. Its vision is to make cloud native ubiquitous. CNCF maintains the **Cloud Native Landscape** ([https://landscape.cncf.io](https://landscape.cncf.io)), which classifies and tracks projects and products in the cloud-native ecosystem and serves as a reference map for developers and enterprises.\\n\\n## Looking ahead\\n\\nJoining the CNCF Landscape reflects progress in Casdoor\u2019s maturity and community. We will keep improving Casdoor and its integration with cloud-native workflows, and we welcome more users and contributors to join the community.\\n\\nEnlaces relacionados:\\n\\n- [Casdoor](https://casdoor.org) \xb7 [GitHub](https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor) \xb7 [Documentation](https://casdoor.org/docs) \xb7 [CNCF Landscape \u2013 Casdoor](https://landscape.cncf.io/?selected=casdoor)"},{"id":"face-authentication-casdoor-sso","metadata":{"permalink":"/es/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-12-face-authentication-casdoor-sso.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-12-face-authentication-casdoor-sso.mdx","title":"Mejorando la seguridad de la aplicaci\xf3n y la experiencia del usuario con Casdoor Face Authentication SSO","description":"En una era donde la gesti\xf3n de la identidad digital es crucial, soluciones de Single Sign-On (SSO) como Casdoor est\xe1n revolucionando la forma en que los usuarios interact\xfaan con m\xfaltiples aplicaciones. El SSO de Casdoor simplifica el proceso de inicio de sesi\xf3n al permitir a los usuarios autenticarse solo una vez para acceder a m\xfaltiples servicios. Esto no solo mejora la comodidad del usuario, sino que tambi\xe9n aumenta el compromiso y la satisfacci\xf3n.","date":"2023-12-12T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Single-Sign-On","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/single-sign-on"},{"inline":true,"label":"Face Recogniztion","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/face-recogniztion"},{"inline":true,"label":"FaceID","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/face-id"},{"inline":true,"label":"Face","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/face"},{"inline":true,"label":"Aprendizaje Autom\xe1tico","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/aprendizaje-automatico"}],"readingTime":2.02,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"James Lawson","title":"Gerente de Producto","url":"https://casdoor.org","imageURL":"https://cdn.casbin.com/casdoor/static/admin.png","key":"James Lawson","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"face-authentication-casdoor-sso","title":"Mejorando la seguridad de la aplicaci\xf3n y la experiencia del usuario con Casdoor Face Authentication SSO","authors":["James Lawson"],"tags":["Casdoor","SSO","Single-Sign-On","Face Recogniztion","FaceID","Face","Aprendizaje Autom\xe1tico"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","permalink":"/es/blog/casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape"},"nextItem":{"title":"Bienvenido","permalink":"/es/blog/bienvenida"}},"content":"En una era donde la gesti\xf3n de la identidad digital es crucial, soluciones de Single Sign-On (SSO) como Casdoor est\xe1n revolucionando la forma en que los usuarios interact\xfaan con m\xfaltiples aplicaciones. El SSO de Casdoor simplifica el proceso de inicio de sesi\xf3n al permitir a los usuarios autenticarse solo una vez para acceder a m\xfaltiples servicios. Esto no solo mejora la comodidad del usuario, sino que tambi\xe9n aumenta el compromiso y la satisfacci\xf3n.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nPara las empresas, el SSO de Casdoor agiliza la gesti\xf3n de credenciales de usuario, mejorando la seguridad y simplificando la incorporaci\xf3n de nuevos usuarios. Contrarresta el riesgo asociado con contrase\xf1as d\xe9biles o recicladas centralizando la gesti\xf3n de usuarios.\\n\\nSin embargo, ante la creciente amenaza en l\xednea, integrar medidas de seguridad robustas en sistemas SSO como Casdoor es vital. Aqu\xed es donde la tecnolog\xeda de autenticaci\xf3n facial entra en juego, agregando una capa extra de protecci\xf3n mientras se mantienen interacciones amigables con el usuario.\\n\\nLa autenticaci\xf3n facial emplea caracter\xedsticas faciales \xfanicas para confirmar las identidades de los usuarios. Compara im\xe1genes en vivo con plantillas faciales almacenadas, ofreciendo una forma segura y sencilla de autenticar a los usuarios. Este m\xe9todo presume de alta precisi\xf3n, incluso bajo condiciones variadas, y es ampliamente adoptado en dispositivos de consumo modernos.\\n\\nIntegrar la autenticaci\xf3n facial en el sistema SSO de Casdoor promete una experiencia de usuario segura, eficiente y sin interrupciones. Para asegurar un rendimiento \xf3ptimo, es crucial enfocarse en:\\n\\n1. _Medidas Anti-Spoofing_: Implementar detecci\xf3n de vivacidad, como seguimiento de movimientos oculares o gestos aleatorios, es esencial para contrarrestar intentos de suplantaci\xf3n y mantener la integridad del sistema.\\n\\n2. _Actualizaciones regulares para mejorar la precisi\xf3n_: Mantener la tecnolog\xeda de autenticaci\xf3n facial actualizada con los \xfaltimos avances en IA y biometr\xeda asegura la precisi\xf3n y mejora la experiencia del usuario. Es vital utilizar conjuntos de datos diversos para el entrenamiento de algoritmos para prevenir sesgos.\\n\\n3. _Equilibrar Seguridad y Comodidad_: Los mejores sistemas logran un equilibrio perfecto entre medidas de seguridad estrictas y comodidad del usuario. Este enfoque fomenta la adopci\xf3n del usuario asegurando un proceso de autenticaci\xf3n sencillo sin comprometer la seguridad.\\n\\nEn conclusi\xf3n, al integrar la autenticaci\xf3n facial con el SSO de Casdoor, las empresas pueden ofrecer una experiencia de inicio de sesi\xf3n segura, eficiente y amigable para el usuario. Esto no solo fortalece la seguridad, sino que tambi\xe9n se alinea con las expectativas modernas de los usuarios en el mundo digital."},{"id":"bienvenida","metadata":{"permalink":"/es/blog/bienvenida","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-24-welcome.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/es/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-24-welcome.mdx","title":"Bienvenido","description":"\xa1Bienvenido al sitio web oficial de Casdoor!\ud83d\udc4b","date":"2021-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Autenticaci\xf3n","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/autenticacion"},{"inline":true,"label":"OAuth2.0","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/o-auth-2-0"},{"inline":true,"label":"Casbin","permalink":"/es/blog/tags/casbin"}],"readingTime":1.49,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"ErikQQY","title":"Miembro de Casbin","url":"https://github.com/ErikQQY","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52615090?s=120&v=4","key":"ErikQQY","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"bienvenida","title":"Bienvenido","authors":["ErikQQY"],"tags":["Casdoor","SSO","Autenticaci\xf3n","OAuth2.0","Casbin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Mejorando la seguridad de la aplicaci\xf3n y la experiencia del usuario con Casdoor Face Authentication SSO","permalink":"/es/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso"}},"content":"\xa1Bienvenido al sitio web oficial de Casdoor!\ud83d\udc4b\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## \xbfQu\xe9 es Casdoor?\\n\\nCasdoor is a UI-first [Identity Access Management (IAM)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Identity_management) / [Single-Sign-On (SSO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single_sign-on) platform based on OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML and CAS.\\n\\nCasdoor is developed by [Casbin](https://casbin.org) using Golang and React.\\n\\nCasdoor tiene como objetivo proporcionar una plataforma de autenticaci\xf3n poderosa para manejar la gesti\xf3n de usuarios.\\n\\n## \xbfPor qu\xe9 usar Casdoor?\\n\\n- \u26a1\ufe0f Funcionalidad potente y configuraci\xf3n simple. With support for  <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_google.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_github.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_facebook.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_twitter.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_linkedin.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_weibo.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_wechat.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_qq.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_dingtalk.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img>   <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_gitee.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img>  <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_wecom.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img><img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_gitlab.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> sign in and traditional username/password sign in, Casdoor helps you implement your users management system just in a few steps.\\n\\n- \ud83d\udca5 Arquitectura de separaci\xf3n de front-end y back-end. Casdoor proporciona una interfaz web maniobrable y soporta alta concurrencia.\\n\\n- \ud83e\udd42 Comunidad de c\xf3digo abierto activa. Casdoor es de c\xf3digo abierto y est\xe1 activamente mantenido.\\n\\n- \ud83c\udf10 Soporte multilenguaje. Casdoor soporta m\xfaltiples idiomas, incluyendo chino, ingl\xe9s, franc\xe9s y muchos m\xe1s.\\n\\n## \xbfC\xf3mo usar Casdoor?\\n\\nYou can follow the detailed document to learn about [Casdoor API](https://door.casdoor.com/swagger/) and [setup your own Casdoor](/docs/basic/server-installation). Or use the [Casdoor SDKs](/docs/how-to-connect/sdk) to implement your own application."}]}}')}}]);